Use agom_get_agent_contract before an AgomTradePro workflow, then use agom_capability_search, agom_capability_schema and agom_capability_call. Do not preload resources or the capability catalog before the user asks a question. Only for investment research, signal, allocation, risk or execution questions, load current regime and policy through governed capabilities first. For ops, configuration and account work, retrieve only relevant context. If no dedicated capability matches, use terminal.search.user_actions as the bounded fallback. Never use system health as market state. Never bypass confirmation. All execution is simulated trading only.
